.TH AITERM 1 "2026-10-04" "aiterm" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aiterm \- turn a natural language request into a shell command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B aiterm [flags] [--] request
.br
.B aiterm -version
.br
.B aiterm -h
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aiterm
sends a natural language request to an OpenAI-compatible chat completions API
and displays the suggested shell command. It does not execute that command
unless you choose \fBy\fR at the confirmation menu.
.PP
You can run the command, copy it, edit and review it, ask a follow-up question
with the conversation context, start a new request, or quit. Flags must come
before the request. Use \fB--\fR before a request that begins with a flag.
.PP
The default endpoint is OpenAI. Set \fBAITERM_URL\fR and \fBAITERM_MODEL\fR to
use another OpenAI-compatible service, such as Ollama or LM Studio.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -key KEY
API key sent as a bearer token. Defaults to \fBOPENAI_KEY\fR. If no key is
available or the key is rejected, \fBaiterm\fR prompts for one without echoing
it. Prefer the environment variable so the key is not recorded in shell history
or the process list.
.TP
.B -model MODEL
Model used to generate commands. Defaults to \fBAITERM_MODEL\fR, or
\fBgpt-4.1-mini\fR if unset.
.TP
.B -url URL
OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint. Defaults to \fBAITERM_URL\fR, or
\fBhttps://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\fR if unset. A warning is printed
when the URL uses plain HTTP to a non-local host.
.TP
.B -timeout DURATION
Maximum time to wait for the API request. Defaults to \fBAITERM_TIMEOUT\fR, or
\fB2m\fR if unset. Use a Go duration such as \fB30s\fR or \fB5m\fR.
.TP
.B -version
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.B -h, -help
Print usage and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OPENAI_KEY
API key for the configured endpoint. It is sent as a bearer token. If absent
or rejected, the application prompts for a key without echoing it.
.TP
.B AITERM_MODEL
Default model. Overridden by \fB-model\fR. The built-in default is
\fBgpt-4.1-mini\fR.
.TP
.B AITERM_URL
Default chat completions endpoint. Overridden by \fB-url\fR. The built-in
default is \fBhttps://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\fR.
.TP
.B AITERM_TIMEOUT
Default API timeout. Overridden by \fB-timeout\fR. The built-in default is two
minutes.
.PP
Command-line settings take precedence over environment variables, which take
precedence over built-in defaults. Set \fBOPENAI_KEY\fR in your shell profile or
enter it at the hidden prompt; avoid passing secrets on the command line.
.SH INTERACTIVE MENU
.TP
.B y
Run the displayed command. For a multi-line command, every line runs after
confirmation.
.TP
.B c
Copy the command to the clipboard and exit. If clipboard support is unavailable,
the command is printed instead.
.TP
.B g
Copy the command, paste an optional edit back into \fBaiterm\fR, review it, and
choose \fBy\fR to run it.
.TP
.B r
Send a follow-up request while keeping the conversation context.
.TP
.B w
Send a new request without the previous conversation context.
.TP
.B q
Quit without running the displayed command.
.PP
If a command fails or is stopped with Ctrl-C, \fBaiterm\fR returns to the menu.
On Linux, clipboard support requires \fBxclip\fR, \fBxsel\fR, or
\fBwl-clipboard\fR; without one, the command is printed for manual copying.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, help or version output, or a normal quit.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime error.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error, such as an invalid flag or a missing request.
.SH SECURITY
Commands are generated by a language model and may be wrong or destructive.
Read the complete command before confirming it. The application refuses replies
containing control or invisible characters that could make the displayed text
differ from what runs, and warns when a command spans multiple lines. Every
line of a multi-line command runs after confirmation. The API key is sent to
the configured endpoint; use HTTPS for remote endpoints. Plain HTTP should be
limited to a trusted service on the same machine.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
aiterm 'find *.log files older than 7 days'
aiterm -model gpt-4.1-mini 'show the 10 largest files in this folder'
AITERM_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions \\
AITERM_MODEL=llama3.2 OPENAI_KEY=ollama aiterm 'summarize disk usage'
.fi
.SH PLATFORM
aiterm currently supports Linux and macOS. Windows is not supported.
.SH SEE ALSO
The README and release notes are at
\fBhttps://github.com/Thakay/aiterm\fR.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at \fBhttps://github.com/Thakay/aiterm/issues\fR.
